5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know exactly how much we'll spend! Can we check the all-in rates and the offshore house prices?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I'm tired of wasting days on transit. I'll look into the ferry and train times, and how we get around.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Rin on costs. I'll check the separately booked rooms from last time and the all-in rates.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I need to know about the bathrooms and the room arrangements. I can't deal with bad sleep again.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll look into the time alone in the shared house and how last year's days actually ran.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, since you're checking all-in rates too, maybe we can compare them together?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,pass,Shunichi,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"That sounds logical, Rin. We can see which method is the most transparent.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, does ""getting around"" include how long we have to wait for buses?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I suspect the environment dictates our mood more than the schedule.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Rin,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll make sure to check the frequency of the transport, Takumi.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,pass,Asuka,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,Thanks. I just don't want to be stuck in one room all day.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,pass,Toshio,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
