35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The island house is cheap per night, but all-in rates mean big eaters and small eaters pay the same.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The ferry is a nightmare; two days gone. The train to the valley is only ninety minutes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Last time, separate rooms caused a huge price gap. A single bill for a whole building is much fairer.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The inn has everyone on futons in one room with strict mealtimes. The island house has only one bathroom.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Last year we drifted apart because we were too separate. But a shared house left us with zero privacy.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, if the island house is one bill, that solves my worry about surprise costs, right?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, the city has trains every few minutes. No waiting, no schedules. It's the most efficient.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"Yes, Rin. A whole-building rental is the only way to ensure no one is quietly out of pocket.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, the city sounds better. I can't do one bathroom for five people or a shared futon room.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,The city break might be too loose. We might end up not seeing each other at all again.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"But the city beds are so expensive! Some are 20,000 yen just for the bed.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Efficiency has a price, but losing two days to a ferry is a waste of a holiday.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"If we do the city, the price disparity from last time will happen again. It's unfair.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I'd rather pay more than spend a week counting the minutes until I can be alone.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"The island forces us together, but as I found, that can feel crowded. We need a middle ground.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I still prefer the island's price, but the bathroom situation sounds scary.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"The valley inn is a decent compromise on travel time, though the bus is limited.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"The valley inn's all-in rate is simpler, but it's still a flat fee regardless of appetite.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,One room for all of us? No way. I'm voting against the inn.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"If we want to actually be a group, the city is too risky.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
