60,3,1,talk,Rin,,I'll vote for the Island. It's the cheapest and the bill is one simple total.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'm voting for the City. The transport is perfect and we don't waste any time.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,I'll go with the Island. A single bill for the house is the only fair way.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Takumi,,City for me. I need my own room and a door I can close.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll vote for the Island. We need to move as a group to avoid drifting apart.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, can't you handle one bathroom for a week?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, you can be a group in a city if you just agree to meet for dinner.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, that's exactly how we end up with different costs for different people.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"No, Rin. Cold water and one shower for five people is a nightmare.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, the data shows that ""loose plans"" lead to people not meeting for whole days.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'm sticking with the Island. It's an adventure!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I can't support the ferry. It's too much waiting.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,The Island is the most logical choice for the budget.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm sticking with the City. My sanity depends on it.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,The Island ensures we actually spend the week together.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
